{"2837690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeons & Dragons: Long Rest Tavern", "steam_appid": 2837690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You’ve fought dragons. You’ve explored dungeons. Now, let someone else take the risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <i>Dungeons &amp; Dragons: Long Rest Tavern</i>, become the heart of every great adventure. Welcome fearless heroes into your tavern, turn their tales into opportunities, and build the coziest, most profitable corner of Faerûn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/97a033095351c39727ac3ece9ea994bf.avif?t=1787833257\" width=1200 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/9cc1158c259804d90491f3da56ab5719.poster.avif?t=1787833257\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/9cc1158c259804d90491f3da56ab5719.webm?t=1787833257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/9cc1158c259804d90491f3da56ab5719.mp4?t=1787833257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Why risk your neck when adventurers are already looking for glory? Send heroes across Faerûn to recover rare ingredients, magical curiosities, and treasures from their quests. Just like any great adventure, their journey is shaped by a roll of the dice, with luck, skill, and fate deciding what they bring back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/71f4cc15392cbdfb9762560b1f6d7973.avif?t=1787833257\" width=1200 height=266 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/8a55e10a481f99acdaabbe0dfcac35ca.poster.avif?t=1787833257\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/8a55e10a481f99acdaabbe0dfcac35ca.webm?t=1787833257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/8a55e10a481f99acdaabbe0dfcac35ca.mp4?t=1787833257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every hero needs a good meal after a hard-fought battle. Create an eclectic menu, discover new recipes, and brew special drinks. Craft iconic dishes and legendary beverages worthy of the adventurers who walk through your door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/1a89b8289a6e147d8b5d1eac8c79a1e6.avif?t=1787833257\" width=1200 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/4d88994cafa6a0debf9b0f5782964899.poster.avif?t=1787833257\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/4d88994cafa6a0debf9b0f5782964899.webm?t=1787833257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/4d88994cafa6a0debf9b0f5782964899.mp4?t=1787833257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A legendary tavern is never quiet. Hire and manage your staff, serve adventurers fresh from their quests, and keep the chaos under control when the common room fills up. Satisfy your guests to maximize your earnings and grow your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/c97f5bd556755de79150db63e0e9c501.avif?t=1787833257\" width=1200 height=266 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/02355f23de3b8ccfe18fa72717261136.poster.avif?t=1787833257\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/02355f23de3b8ccfe18fa72717261136.webm?t=1787833257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/02355f23de3b8ccfe18fa72717261136.mp4?t=1787833257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start with a humble establishment and upgrade, decorate, and optimize your tavern to shape it into a destination worth returning to. Every decoration tells a story, reflecting the cultures, characters, and adventures that make your tavern unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/dd65b170e1fe287271e39c01cf0a6241.avif?t=1787833257\" width=1200 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/cbef428af9e2d44307ac837a40e14ffe.poster.avif?t=1787833257\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/cbef428af9e2d44307ac837a40e14ffe.webm?t=1787833257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837690/extras/cbef428af9e2d44307ac837a40e14ffe.mp4?t=1787833257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Some faces you’ll recognize. Others you’ll want to learn more about. Every legend who walks through your door carries a story waiting to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every legend needs a long rest.</strong> </h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">